<<do tag "up">><<if $gender is "Girl">><label id="upbring1"><<radiobutton "$upbring" "attwhore" autocheck>> Attention whore./*(F only.)*/</label><<else>>Choose another gender to select this upbringing.<</if>>
<<if $gender is "Guy">><label id="upbring2"><<radiobutton "$upbring" "loud" autocheck>> Loud and obnoxious./*(M only.)*/</label><<else>>Choose another gender to select this upbringing.<</if>><</do>>
<label><<radiobutton "$upbring" "nerd">> Unpopular nerd./*(allows for TF start for both F and M, has an easier time becoming friends with Chloe.)*/</label></div>

